<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX closes up led by Komercni, SPT Telecom.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX closes up led by Komercni, SPT Telecom.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - The Czech RPIX closes up on Tuesday as Komercni Banka and SPT Telecom post strong gains.</p>
<p>*  Reuters RPIX index rises 23.9 points, 2.27 percent, to 1,078.9.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 24.4 million crowns.</p>
<p>* Komercni rises 102 crowns to 1,787. Dealers said they knew of no reasons for the rise.</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom rises 165 crowns to 4,040.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
